msgstr "Instalação do zsh"

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><para>
#: blfs-en/postlfs/shells/zsh.xml:94
#, xml-text
msgid ""
"The documentation files contain references to zsh configuration files in "
"<filename class='directory'>/etc</filename>, but we'll use <filename "
"class='directory'>/etc/zsh</filename> to hold these configuration files "
"instead. The build system will update those references if the "
"<application>yodl</application> package is available, but it's out of the "
"scope of BLFS. As a result, we need to fix the references manually:"
msgstr ""
"Os arquivos de documentação contém referências aos arquivos de configuração "
"do zsh em <filename class='directory'>/etc</filename>, mas nós usaremos "
"<filename class='directory'>/etc/zsh</filename> para armazenar esses "
"arquivos de configuração em vez disso. O sistema de construção atualizará "
"essas referências se o pacote <application>yodl</application> estiver "
"disponível, mas ele está fora do escopo do BLFS. Como resultado, nós "
"precisamos corrigir as referências manualmente:"

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><screen>
#: blfs-en/postlfs/shells/zsh.xml:103
#, no-wrap, xml-text
msgid ""
"<userinput>sed -e 's|/etc/z|/etc/zsh/z|g' \\\n"
"    -i Doc/*.*</userinput>"
msgstr ""
"<userinput>sed -e 's|/etc/z|/etc/zsh/z|g' \\\n"
"    -i Doc/*.*</userinput>"

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><para>
#: blfs-en/postlfs/shells/zsh.xml:115
#, xml-text
msgid ""
"Install <application>zsh</application> by running the following commands:"
msgstr ""
"Instale <application>zsh</application> executando os seguintes comandos:"

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><screen>
#: blfs-en/postlfs/shells/zsh.xml:119
#, no-wrap, xml-text
msgid ""
"<userinput>./configure --prefix=/usr            \\\n"
"            --sysconfdir=/etc/zsh    \\\n"
"            --enable-etcdir=/etc/zsh \\\n"
"            --enable-cap             \\\n"
"            --enable-gdbm            \\\n"
"            --enable-pcre            &amp;&amp;\n"
"make                                 &amp;&amp;\n"
"\n"
"makeinfo  Doc/zsh.texi --html      -o Doc/html &amp;&amp;\n"
"makeinfo  Doc/zsh.texi --plaintext -o zsh.txt  &amp;&amp;\n"
"makeinfo  Doc/zsh.texi --html --no-split --no-headers -o zsh.html</userinput>"
msgstr ""
"<userinput>./configure --prefix=/usr            \\\n"
"            --sysconfdir=/etc/zsh    \\\n"
"            --enable-etcdir=/etc/zsh \\\n"
"            --enable-cap             \\\n"
"            --enable-gdbm            \\\n"
"            --enable-pcre            &amp;&amp;\n"
"make                                 &amp;&amp;\n"
"\n"
"makeinfo  Doc/zsh.texi --html      -o Doc/html &amp;&amp;\n"
"makeinfo  Doc/zsh.texi --plaintext -o zsh.txt  &amp;&amp;\n"
"makeinfo  Doc/zsh.texi --html --no-split --no-headers -o zsh.html</userinput>"

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><para>
#: blfs-en/postlfs/shells/zsh.xml:132
#, xml-text
msgid ""
"If you have <xref linkend=\"texlive\"/> installed, you can build the "
"documentation in PDF format by issuing the following command:"
msgstr ""
"Se você tiver <xref linkend=\"texlive\"/> instalado, poderá construir a "
"documentação no formato PDF emitindo o seguinte comando:"

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><screen>
#: blfs-en/postlfs/shells/zsh.xml:137
#, no-wrap, xml-text
msgid "<userinput>texi2pdf  Doc/zsh.texi -o Doc/zsh.pdf</userinput>"
msgstr "<userinput>texi2pdf Doc/zsh.texi -o Doc/zsh.pdf</userinput>"

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><para>
#: blfs-en/postlfs/shells/zsh.xml:140
#, xml-text
msgid "To test the results, issue: <command>make check</command>."
msgstr "Para testar os resultados, emita: <command>make check</command>."

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><para>
#: blfs-en/postlfs/shells/zsh.xml:144
#, xml-text
msgid "Now, as the <systemitem class=\"username\">root</systemitem> user:"
msgstr ""
"Agora, como o(a) usuário(a) <systemitem "
"class=\"username\">root</systemitem>:"

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><screen>
#: blfs-en/postlfs/shells/zsh.xml:147
#, no-wrap, xml-text
msgid ""
"<userinput>make install                                                    &amp;&amp;\n"
"make infodir=/usr/share/info install.info                       &amp;&amp;\n"
"make htmldir=/usr/share/doc/zsh-&zsh-version;/html install.html         &amp;&amp;\n"
"install -v -m644 zsh.{html,txt} Etc/FAQ /usr/share/doc/zsh-&zsh-version;</userinput>"
msgstr ""
"<userinput>make install                                                    &amp;&amp;\n"
"make infodir=/usr/share/info install.info                       &amp;&amp;\n"
"make htmldir=/usr/share/doc/zsh-&zsh-version;/html install.html         &amp;&amp;\n"
"install -v -m644 zsh.{html,txt} Etc/FAQ /usr/share/doc/zsh-&zsh-version;</userinput>"

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><para>
#: blfs-en/postlfs/shells/zsh.xml:153
#, xml-text
msgid ""
"If you built the PDF format of the documentation, install it by issuing the "
"following command as the <systemitem class=\"username\">root</systemitem> "
"user:"
msgstr ""
"Se você construiu o formato PDF da documentação, [então] instale-o emitindo "
"o seguinte comando como o(a) usuário(a) <systemitem "
"class=\"username\">root</systemitem>:"

